{
  "name": "Expanded Matter",
  "requiresMod": "em",
  "//": "Crushed and powdered ores, metals and stones, ashes, lyes and the extra minerals (gypsum, soda, mercury, iodine, pigments). Crushing and grinding recipes value most of these already; these ratios and values are the fallback: a crushed or powdered ore is worth the base game's nugget of it, crushed metal a twentieth of the ingot (one nugget), crushed stone a rock, ashes 2. Only used when nothing else values the item.",
